# Copy to `.env.local`. `.env*` is gitignored.
#
# Decides which backend serves `/api/*` in development. Set it and the Vite dev server proxies
# `/api/*` to the Spring backend; comment it out and the Next.js Route Handlers + D1 serve the app
# exactly as before. See vite.config.ts and backend/README.md section 7.
HANDOVER_API_TARGET=http://localhost:8080
